# Interview packs

When an admin asks for a company pack, write one JSON file in this repo. Do not add an admin app.

- Path: `content/packs/<pack-id>/pack.json`. `<pack-id>` is kebab-case, 1–80 characters, such as `grab-ai-platform-senior`.
- Require a company, a role, a level (`mid`, `senior`, or `staff`), and 1–5 sources. A source is a pasted note or an `http`/`https` URL. With no source, ask for one and do not write the file.
- `exclusive` defaults to true. Set false only when the admin says the pack is free.
- Write 1–3 questions. Each has a title, a prompt, 3–8 probes, a reference architecture, and these rubric dimensions in order: requirements, estimation, architecture, depth, tradeoffs, communication, ai_concerns.
- Write in English. Write original practice prompts. State a company fact only when a source supports it. Label anything else `Practice expectation:`.
- A URL source stores the URL in `body` and a short reviewed quote in `excerpt`.
- Run `npm test` and fix the file until it passes.
- Do not commit until the admin asks. Publishing is a pull request merged to the default branch.

